  "unreadable": [
    "power-header position 1: top hole above IOREF has no silkscreen or callout label (unlabeled)."
  ],
  "notes": "Label = printed GPIO name or callout power/control name; silkscreen spelling first in functions (e.g. 13, RX, RST, AREF, IOREF, +/-), then the CircuitPython name and outward. Green 'Power Domain' tags (RTC, CPU) omitted as category-only tags. ADCx_CHy underscores not visible on the dark ADC tags (other tags show underscores); written as ADCx_CHy. MicroSD slot callouts (MISO/MOSI/SCK/SD_CS) describe the card slot, not a wiring point, and were skipped, as were the DC jack, USB, NeoPixel, buttons, LEDs, ON/OFF switch and the unlabeled JTAG 2x5 header."
